  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "2420-root",
    "title": "AKU-ISMC Alumni  Set Up \"Be-khudi\"",
    "subtitle": "A New Platform for Meditation and Mindfulness",
    "summary": "AKU-ISMC's alumni set up a platform for meditation in English and Urdu.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "dc66b8e7e98659e1",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "2420-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/2420-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "AKU-ISMC Alumni  Set Up \"Be-khudi\""
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "In these complicated times, more and more people are looking online to help them find a sense of calm and wellbeing. AKU-ISMC alumni, Tehmina Mansoor and Zohaib Zuby have responded to this by setting up a platform sharing guided meditations in Urdu and English. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Be-khudi ",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GwRl4KpDoVI",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "combines wisdom from their native South Asia with the discipline of Mindfulness and is the first platform to offer meditations in both languages. Tehmina explains how Be-khudi is developing during the pandemic; \"We launched in January of this year right before lockdown and posted our free Urdu and English Meditations as an album.\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As lockdown continued Tehmina started receiving requests for more support. This led to the creation of a new meditation - specially addressing the frightening effects of the pandemic; the \""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Mindful Conversation",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "link",
                  "attrs": {
                    "href": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3R51ZrX0eMY&t=142s",
                    "target": "_blank",
                    "linktype": "url",
                    "uuid": null,
                    "anchor": null,
                    "custom": {}
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "\" series which launched in July and is especially aimed at people feeling affected by the post-covid life. Tehmina adds; \"Most of the people registering wrote about having trouble in their new post-covid life. Some are having a problem with routine, some have a problem with managing children; and so on. This is a free service, just like all the meditations we have posted online. We have since gotten a very good response.\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "hard_break"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
